# Force LF in the working tree for all text files.
#
# This repository is built and run inside Linux containers. On a Windows
# checkout Git would otherwise convert line endings to CRLF, and a stray \r
# breaks two things: shell here-docs / scripts run during the Docker build, and
# the backslash line-continuations in the multi-line RUN steps of the
# Dockerfiles. Normalising to LF keeps `docker compose up --build` working
# identically on Windows, macOS and Linux.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Files that MUST stay Unix-formatted inside a container.
*.sh        text eol=lf
Dockerfile  text eol=lf
*.yml       text eol=lf
*.yaml      text eol=lf
*.json      text eol=lf
*.css       text eol=lf
*.cs        text eol=lf
*.ts        text eol=lf
*.tsx       text eol=lf

# Binary assets — never normalise or diff as text.
*.png   binary
*.jpg   binary
*.jpeg  binary
*.ico   binary
*.woff  binary
*.woff2 binary
*.pdf   binary
